    Smoke fixtures: supply the mandatory Founder reporting policy
    
    `government/sitting.sh` and the cycle scripts hard-require
    `government/AGENT-REPORTING-POLICY.md` in the town and fail closed when it
    is absent. Every hermetic fixture that builds a partial scratch town
    therefore aborted with "Viche: mandatory Founder agent policy missing".
    
    Copy the real policy file into each fixture town, the same way the
    fixtures already copy the other production files they exercise. This
    changes test scaffolding only; no production behaviour, gate, or
    protected record is touched.
    
    Before: 10 of 49 tests failed with this error on canonical main 91a136e.
    After: 1 of them still fails for an unrelated stale-state reason
    (innovation-centre-smoke), and setup-only tests now run.
    
    Not delivered: main remains red at tests/ballot-integrity.sh (protected
    M-024 ballot records) and tests/boot-smoke.sh, so the full Act 21 gate
    is still unsatisfiable pending those independent causes.

